[{"title":"自水帘洞入黄龙洞","author":"欧大任","text":"洞口嵚崟石作闾，珠帘千尺更何如。\n楼看建武将军节，山待琅琊处士居。\n空里铁桥还蹑屐，云边玉笥可藏书。\n不须此日歌招隐，丛桂青青映草庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8131,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花村","author":"欧大任","text":"路入罗山下，春深啼鸟繁。\n飞花馀古树，流水自柴门。\n桂父家何在，梅仙市尚存。\n金砂如可学，吾欲访轩辕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8132,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朱明观承郭学宪胡计部叶刺史雨中过集得来字","author":"欧大任","text":"雨过万山雷，云深半未开。\n游仙时一到，望气客能来。\n上代朱明馆，中天白玉台。\n榴花春酿熟，倘肯对衔杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8133,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"由青霞至石洞访叶化甫得青字","author":"欧大任","text":"谷口轩车过，寻君路始经。\n星曾窥太白，云自上空青。\n书著虞卿日，玄留蜀客亭。\n似闻羔币起，未许久沉冥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8134,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同子朋仲良由大小石楼至泉源福地","author":"欧大任","text":"二石楼高昼不扃，天门咫尺是殊庭。\n丹光五色浮林霭，云术千盘合海灵。\n飞步佩环仙共引，新宫日月客能铭。\n风前几度璈笙过，只许缑山白鹤听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8135,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登飞云顶","author":"欧大任","text":"壁削云浮万丈梯，清都近夏尚凄凄。\n沧溟日浴扶桑外，衡石花开建木西。\n望入楼台知海蜃，坐闻风雨报天鸡。\n安期倘有东来约，四百峰头遍可栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8136,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同郭学宪叶剌史宴朱明馆十二韵","author":"欧大任","text":"海上标名胜，东南一壮观。\n诸峰沧岛合，二曜洞天宽。\n屐许畸人约，轺来野老欢。\n青牛周柱史，金马汉祠官。\n松子迎瑶节，芝童候玉鞍。\n铁桥千丈过，珠瀑几回看。\n苔藓封岩磴，风雷绕石坛。\n客栖犹有馆，仙去尚遗丹。\n深树春偏艳，清潭夏更寒。\n茅柴盈涧榼，薇蕨佐山盘。\n篆叶符常在，铭烟字未残。\n云中鸡犬散，此日聚星冠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8137,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郭学宪出罗浮有寄用韵和答","author":"欧大任","text":"登高作赋羡君侯，远为仙山引绛驺。\n正值通明句曲隐，幸陪康乐永嘉游。\n茏葱草树回岩磴，突兀风云满石楼。\n去矣天南吾自老，已期猿鹤八千秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8138,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阁夜","author":"欧大任","text":"缥缈飞楼夜色澄，惺惺犹在白云层。\n自知木雁同庄叟，不为莼鲈学季鹰。\n隐几风前江客笛，卷帘天畔海渔灯。\n重溟已息图南翼，九万扶摇尚未能。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8139,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"灌园","author":"欧大任","text":"溪头园小水为矶，行汲时扃白板扉。\n百亩纵营金谷胜，几人能向玉门归。\n荔枝可饱瓜先熟，橘子将成笋尚肥。\n莫笑野夫犹抱瓮，半生吾已息吾机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8140,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻邵长孺讣","author":"欧大任","text":"别来吾自忆侯芭，岂意华年日易斜。\n马策只闻从槜李，牛衣宁及理秦瓜。\n云霄岁远青门路，风雨秋残白岳花。\n独有千年遗札在，莫传奇字似杨家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8141,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答马参军用昭金陵见寄","author":"欧大任","text":"名都握管可能同，一札谁将寄海鸿。\n留府参军推鲍照，甘泉作赋待扬雄。\n楼前夜傍胡床月，酒后秋生越锷风。\n回首旧游心更远，相思犹在大江东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8142,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻潘司寇以右都御史起治河","author":"欧大任","text":"蒲轮徵起五湖西，金印重劳使相携。\n不待临流沉白马，即看画壤锡玄圭。\n功存疏凿身曾历，书勒河渠手自题。\n岭表遥占安石出，明年促召入彤闱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8143,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感秋","author":"欧大任","text":"青女霜飞醉倚楼，得归偏喜故园秋。\n潇湘江上孤舟客，木落猿啼并是愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8144,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白云池上","author":"欧大任","text":"水满江乡菰米肥，秋风新洒薜萝衣。\n摩诃池畔鹅群散，无数蜻蜓上下飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8145,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒游效邵尧夫体","author":"欧大任","text":"竹冠藤杖两棕鞋，老去闲游学打乖。\n一饭至今仍苜蓿，三杯宁得厌茅柴。\n敢期短发身长健，已许名山骨可埋。\n千载几如彭泽令，翛然吾自委吾怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8146,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题梁伯遐临漪亭","author":"欧大任","text":"孙登百泉隐，长啸似君閒。\n白鸟池头水，青鸳屋上山。\n摊书霞满席，洗屐月临关。\n客有逍遥论，唯应数往还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8147,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送梁祠部持伯还朝","author":"欧大任","text":"近臣肃穆谒明光，冠佩行随鹓鹭行。\n花发掖垣催视草，日趋黼扆待含香。\n石渠早下诸儒诏，宝鼎同称万岁觞。\n知尔不徒工染翰，应逢停辇答君王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8148,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答孙齐之吴下见寄","author":"欧大任","text":"阊阖城头白雁声，书来千里见平生。\n我从海峤游方适，君已天台赋早成。\n马队不妨犹讲肆，蚁陂何必但藏名。\n三年欲报相思字，惟有梅花驿使行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8149,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"淇园山房为潘子迁赋","author":"欧大任","text":"选胜新开淇上园，宛然洛涘似潘安。\n宿烟葱茜青千亩，夹水檀栾绿万竿。\n游处鸣弦春自媚，閒来散帙夏偏寒。\n题诗更过辛夷馆，为有丛篁许客看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8150,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和答朱驾部可大登镇海楼见寄","author":"欧大任","text":"朔雪燕霜是旧游，南来今已及深秋。\n正看浴日通鲛浦，忽漫飞鸿过郁洲。\n奉使不劳司马檄，题诗多在尉陀楼。\n相逢预恐离群易，江水蘼芜绾别愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8151,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陆给谏朱驾部校士还朝","author":"欧大任","text":"炎州万里汉衣冠，六传飞驰夹路看。\n自昔越裳收翡翠，只今沧海贡琅玕。\n旌旗度岭关云散，环佩趋朝朔雪寒。\n两省近臣新荐士，尽随春色入长安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8152,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送陈忠甫游南岳","author":"欧大任","text":"远心先寄五游踪，望入衡云几万重。\n已羡向平今独往，尚怜禽庆未能从。\n星冠夜礼朱陵洞，烟策秋登紫盖峰。\n去去便应周四岳，赋成还及汉家封。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8153,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答程无过见怀","author":"欧大任","text":"尺素何来度岭轺，征鸿南下朔风骄。\n所思歙浦年频改，一别胥湖路已遥。\n墙溷半荒残笔札，江山无恙老渔樵。\n愧君犹奉河西箧，隐几时时慰寂寥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8154,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭王敬美二首 其一","author":"欧大任","text":"阊阖天高鸿雁疏，修文君去重欷歔。\n珊瑚沧海千言里，騕袅中原万里馀。\n病赋归来匡阜社，死留消渴茂陵书。\n寄将一掬南州泪，还忆枫林策素车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8155,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭王敬美二首 其二","author":"欧大任","text":"风起萧萧古白杨，七哀何处不心伤。\n虚疑懒似才中散，宁复斋如老奉常。\n绿绮无弦歌已绝，青山有剑路空长。\n可堪絮酒天涯去，匹练吴门更渺茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8156,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同邓山人君肃饮梁太守挺豫园池","author":"欧大任","text":"杜陵初解郡，二仲可能来。\n似向花源入，依然竹径开。\n槛前鱼戏近，海上鹤飞回。\n玉树偏相傍，谁如谢氏才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8157,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同叔祥季美季德道子过花竹清居","author":"欧大任","text":"门径欢相过，荀陈谊自深。\n芝兰偏满室，薜荔已成阴。\n浊酒全生理，匡床出世心。\n非君能爱客，谁许数来寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8158,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日同惟仁叔祥季美君玺季德君美道子虹山赏梅花得园字","author":"欧大任","text":"馆近梅花大树村，葛洪去后几株存。\n香闻半岭空鸾啸，月挂高枝有鹤翻。\n岁暮莫吹江客笛，山寒犹在汝阴园。\n醉来欲寄游仙梦，一过朱明古洞门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8159,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同陈少原邓君肃梁丙孺陈于冈潘子迁苏叔大僧继真集诃林净社","author":"欧大任","text":"净土精修白业长，入山犹得问支郎。\n阁悬沧海摩尼色，塔涌炎州舍利光。\n满坐异香分薝卜，小林祇树遍桄榔。\n人天可是莲华社，嗜酒偏容处士狂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8160,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘山中郑祖皞黄用砺入社","author":"欧大任","text":"风流二客幸同时，几杖烟霞晚更移。\n匡阜白莲能共社，会稽林竹旧相期。\n丹丘不隔珊瑚井，明月犹通玉液池。\n扶醉清秋凝望处，西来山色碧参差。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8161,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪","author":"欧大任","text":"朔雪凭陵旅雁哀，閟寒今见六花开。\n所思琼树移江苑，忽漫瑶华送粤台。\n梁客应推能赋入，郢人还更和歌来。\n此时藜杖临丹壑，岂少梅花水部才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8162,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘少脩姚继昭陈鸣翊三子入社","author":"欧大任","text":"衣冠洛社日追攀，三益能来竹径閒。\n暂许客游从北海，不妨朝寄在东山。\n谷深纵遣鸣驺入，林密惟知倦鸟还。\n咫尺朱明心并远，与君携手白云间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8163,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"伯玉少璋虞卿少功启明上元夜过","author":"欧大任","text":"白头方朔奉恩回，田烛村灯社事开。\n花月春江人尽乐，草堂烟径客能来。\n觞行解把银缸照，巾舞宁知玉漏催。\n记得祠膏曾侍从，愧君犹道汉臣才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8164,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘八景 其一 紫烟楼","author":"欧大任","text":"冥冥洞壑青，漠漠山烟紫。\n仙人驷苍虬，忽向神霄起。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8165,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘八景 其二 晚沐堂","author":"欧大任","text":"赐沐有金钱，载酒西园暮。\n岂但沉隐侯，郊居白门赋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8166,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘八景 其三 珊瑚井","author":"欧大任","text":"涨海珊瑚洲，潮来通石井。\n汲之炼药成，丹光二云顶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8167,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘八景 其四 大雅堂","author":"欧大任","text":"桂树淹淮客，椒丘寄楚辞。\n风流沧海上，何羡习家池。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8168,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘八景 其五 留舄亭","author":"欧大任","text":"飞仙辞阜乡，玉舄留斯亭。\n所餐蒲九节，涧上至今青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8169,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘八景 其六 朱明馆","author":"欧大任","text":"浮石白云麓，西开朱明户。\n丹梯曾未遥，缥缈升真路。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8170,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘八景 其七 挹袖轩","author":"欧大任","text":"珠浦三千里，璇房一万年。\n河车功已毕，来此学游仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8171,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘八景 其八 听笙亭","author":"欧大任","text":"吹笙伊洛来，凤鸾犹可遇。\n傥得浮丘公，接上崧高去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8172,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日和答姚继如都下见怀二首 其一","author":"欧大任","text":"别来京辇客，天末怅离居。\n南国经春梦，西台隔岁书。\n雪深劳独骑，江远报双鱼。\n笔札吾犹懒，何能赋遂初。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8173,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日和答姚继如都下见怀二首 其二","author":"欧大任","text":"一从辞禁省，颇得事幽寻。\n山屐更为齿，林冠屡不簪。\n学耕沧海曲，投老白云深。\n岂必归来是，金门且陆沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8174,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"社会赋得送归鸿","author":"欧大任","text":"嗈嗈鸣处荻芽肥，客岁霜前下钓矶。\n候暖暂辞沧海去，春深翻向玉门飞。\n可能戢羽群栖泊，忽漫挥弦一送归。\n为尔临风凝望久，上林从此信音稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8175,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和大司马总制刘公端州见五云","author":"欧大任","text":"崧台东去过严城，虎旅遥看十万行。\n山带星光开晓色，日高云彩炫春情。\n昆崙关外夷方垒，浪泊沙边汉将营。\n平越谁如今制胜，由来神武是先声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8176,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再和刘公闻鹊志喜","author":"欧大任","text":"海色曈昽雁翅城，军前授律六师行。\n建牙檐鹊频催晓，飞舰樯乌正喜晴。\n即睹鲸鲵新筑观，不劳貔虎更分营。\n南征最是波平日，笳鼓旋听凯乐声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8177,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和答王太古见寄","author":"欧大任","text":"江南双鲤入春潮，客寄梁溪隐更招。\n都讲每从支遁坐，赁舂犹在伯通桥。\n椷来白雪歌难和，梦去青山路已遥。\n强欲报君无尺素，橘洲空自老渔樵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8178,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王伯坚以墙东小隐自署答其来韵因成题篇","author":"欧大任","text":"家出琅琊六代馀，墙东避世偶成居。\n秦川少作中郎客，楚相能题孺仲书。\n自有蓬蒿深息鴳，一从濠濮久知鱼。\n地偏可是心曾远，凿涧开林好结庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8179,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郭学宪舜举参藩山西三首 其一","author":"欧大任","text":"岭表儒宗汉使同，玺书授节过河东。\n廷推给饷萧丞相，人识单车郭令公。\n沙草微茫驱伏兔，关城迢递送飞鸿。\n雁门马邑曾非远，咫尺京台正郁葱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8180,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郭学宪舜举参藩山西三首 其二","author":"欧大任","text":"周邦方岳冠诸侯，赐履今看据上游。\n九塞黄榆开朔漠，五原白草出并州。\n乐非金石和戎日，赋似旌旗校猎秋。\n汾晋征繇闻转急，富民终赖借前筹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8181,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送郭学宪舜举参藩山西三首 其三","author":"欧大任","text":"行操笔橐事櫜鞬，西使声华六传前。\n飞挽独悬秦障塞，封疆犹画晋山川。\n迎营句注能千里，忽厌承明已几年。\n严助召还堪计日，侍臣如雨在甘泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8182,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈大参道襄七十一初度","author":"欧大任","text":"朱衣白简侍彤庭，名姓三朝在御屏。\n方伯部中尊赐履，曲台门下老传经。\n筵开五月菖蒲碧，海涌三山菡萏青。\n八十汾阳公尚少，寿星光傍太微星。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8183,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答尹昆润登海上洲见寄","author":"欧大任","text":"谁期朱绂客，书札问抽簪。\n云梦田非赐，王官谷自深。\n隐招青桂长，禅悦白烟沉。\n君傥还京阙，知予寄定林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8184,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄题芾斯宗侯逸园","author":"欧大任","text":"天已佚君老，园开湖水头。\n戏鱼搏浪日，修竹夹池秋。\n烟际莺为谷，霜前雁是洲。\n梁王宾客在，作赋几时游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8185,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘评事少修浮丘别业社集","author":"欧大任","text":"乘凉出郭命巾车，宴客西池脍有鱼。\n阁倚浮丘深凿翠，觞行流水曲通渠。\n窗间萝薜萦犹上，户外烟霞绣不如。\n更向墙阴窥笔砚，知君新著茂陵书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8186,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽朱贞吉","author":"欧大任","text":"帝家仙鸟自迦陵，岂但称诗起中兴。\n经在共知刘子政，书成谁似李阳冰。\n天边客梦为蝴蝶，海上神游学大鹏。\n哭汝不堪还雪涕，匡山犹忆十年灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8187,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初夏社集张转运伯邻园中得雨","author":"欧大任","text":"辟疆园傍粤城隅，河朔群游兴不孤。\n乍起夏云团远树，即看凉雨散平芜。\n碧筒杯送池边石，白玉盘行竹下厨。\n谁道炎天愁赤日，浴凫飞鹭在江湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8188,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答朱履方雪后见怀","author":"欧大任","text":"白雪何来寄楚音，石头渡口未浮沉。\n江横叠嶂孤城角，岭隔飞鸿万户砧。\n投老地偏犹小隐，怀人天远独长吟。\n他时纵有停云赋，东去名山恐更深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8189,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答宗侯文季","author":"欧大任","text":"忆君朱邸傍湖东，甲秀西堂万卷中。\n邺下游从多好客，夷门车骑每趋风。\n谁能小友逢王粲，敢以通家视孔融。\n劳寄清诗不成寐，夜深凉月上梧桐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8190,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送家侄葆会武试入都二首 其一","author":"欧大任","text":"尔去西京都肄时，蹶张超距满前麾。\n筑坛傥遇萧何荐，万一能搴大将旗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8191,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送家侄葆会武试入都二首 其二","author":"欧大任","text":"秋鹰侧目正愁胡，赌墅还持丈二殳。\n白首主恩吾未报，家儿得似谢玄无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8192,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"看奕棋","author":"欧大任","text":"楸枰对奕向江湍，珍簟朱帘夏亦寒。\n自笑旁观松树下，可能犹作谢公看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8193,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杨民部肖韩入浮丘社得成字","author":"欧大任","text":"胜侣集柴荆，名山不入城。\n飞栖惟乐志，喧寂自浮生。\n濠上游方待，河东赋已成。\n谷莺啼近客，半似和歌声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8194,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠吉州李玉华山人","author":"欧大任","text":"白鹤青松下，岩栖未定居。\n琴弹梅渚曲，扇作蕺山书。\n巾屦游秦徼，风烟过楚墟。\n看君西笑日，乘兴复何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8195,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"适西粤江上逢陈梧州","author":"欧大任","text":"昔别燕台月，重逢桂水波。\n酒船吾自棹，租舫似闻歌。\n玉帐提封远，铜符出牧多。\n济江君早去，星汉夜如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":8196,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]